Sval: Remove the Touch Bar

Sval gives the macOS Touch Bar no buttons of its own. The front end
(MacTouchBar and its components), the Cocoa widget code that built the
bar for each window, the Customize Touch Bar items in the application
menu and in Customize Toolbar, the urlbar's Touch Bar search mode entry,
their interfaces, strings, docs and tests go. A window that builds no
bar of its own shows the Touch Bar macOS gives any app.

